Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,He {\c&H3B30FF&}destroyed{\c&HFFFFFF&} two startups\Nin under two minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Some good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}I've had your drink mixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Here it is in a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Cheers then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}You go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Does it taste good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}I like the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}chalky…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:40.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}and quite bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}This is one of your products?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Describe what's on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}I think it's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Fun, unique, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:50.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}So it's a unique product.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Here's one of your competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}Now to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}that looks exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}To me, they don't look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}They're identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}It's hand-packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}That won't matter to the consumer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}I think the bow on top
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}adds to the value.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,30)}So it's the bow?
